🎨 UI Components
MapView.tsx
- Initializes Leaflet map
- Loads and renders markers
- Applies category-based filter
- Handles map interaction and popup

MapSidebar.tsx
- Category filter toggles
- Simple legend (icon + label)
- Optional: Reset filters button

MapPopup.tsx
- Displays marker info

⚠️ Known Constraints
No user contributions or reviews in MVP
No dynamic data refresh
No personalization (yet)
JSON file must be manually updated with new locations

✅ Deployment Notes
Serve the locations.json embedded in your build.
